# Revision: 184
# Author: iustus
# Date: 2006-12-14T22:52:22.730017Z
# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   big sea assault changes:
#   - cities build transports and escorts more often when in sea war, also building units to go on them when needed
#   - CvSelectionGroup::isFull returns true if there are some units in the group which do not transport special units (catches case where a caravel has escort sea missionAI, so an assault stack is never full)
#   - new CvSelectionGroup::setTransportUnit, splits the group and loads multiple units
#   - new CvSelectionGroup::splitGroup, splits group into two new groups, trying to keep unitAIs even in both
#   - CvSelectionGroup::mergeIntoGroup now changes the unitAI of a unit, if it is becoming the new head, and doing so would change the unitAI of the group, if the new head can take the old head's unitAI
#   - new version of AI_unitTargetMissionAIs which takes an array of missionAIs to compare against
#   - AI_group and AI_groupMergeRange do not group if the unit is on a transport
#   - AI_load splits the group and loads the whole group that can fit onto the transport, it prefers transports that have enough room for as much of the group as possible
#   - AI_assaultSeaMove waits if any units are headed toward the transport
#   - AI_assaultSeaMove makes larget stacks
#   
#   chipotle changes: ctrl mouse over units gives much more information about the group and its mission
# Changed paths (11):
